<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-19T13:38:42.814Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:38:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Trump arrived in Manila for a state visit, meeting President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. and discussing defence and economic deals while the ASEAN summit convened. The Philippine Coast Guard recorded 19 Chinese warships and coast guard vessels operating around Ayungin Shoal, Bajo de Masinloc, Escoda Shoal and Pag-asa Island from Nov. 9 to 16, prompting legislator Tarriela to condemn the incursions. Australia and the Philippines signed a new defence cooperation arrangement to deepen security ties. The UCDP recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/18/world/canada/trump-carney-meeting-asia-us-canada-trade.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9SMjBaUkhva3F0V2lNb3pUanRWRDRjdjNreFRyc1cxMzlxMXBIMVJRR3RIUnFMSUZpQUtYMDlnM0NWLXVqU0tnampxRWphSjB2cUtlaUtJTUVoNTdVdE5SWDQxRUZibWRuYVRtVEt1cjFNRkQya0gtTk5R?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/week-asia/people/article/3375057/elon-musk-quietly-developing-one-or-two-philippine-islands-manila-envoy-says&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNeFlRb3RwMVQ5MjFSS1VvbjlDX0Z2WHdobzBMOERGTXVnRFNNbzdsdWVzNXFSR1k4Y1d4cnEwMTZiSFItWFR0SmZCTnEwcVNWazNPSDg5ZWUzQUNBQUhiZ3VFUHVscXhUUjROYlV3MFRKVnF3WFYwMXp6d3l6b2xQZXB1aDI3RUVhTFRUaTRCTFQyd2tncmFWLW5odTRleTNmb25XWk55Q012ZkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPaElJOGZ5VmlYN1ptRXl4aFo4RWsxd21qSWlqb2w3amVBTGU3RHJuandfNk